i.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101979","id":3313906268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FhjJc","user":{"login":"PatIndermuehle","id":153449957,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSV15Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153449957?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle","html_url":"https://github.com/PatIndermuehle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T21:36:31Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T21:36:31Z","body":"Hello\nI have just tested the Minimal reproduction project with the release version 4.5 of Godot and the issue still remains.\nI have also noticed the same issue happens when using C#.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313906268/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3339933567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101979#issuecomment-3339933567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101979","id":3339933567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HE1d_","user":{"login":"PatIndermuehle","id":153449957,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSV15Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153449957?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle","html_url":"https://github.com/PatIndermuehle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T18:20:40Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T18:20:40Z","body":"Hello\n\nI would like to help to fix the bug since it affects my personal project too, but I am stuck on finding the issue. \nI have managed to compile the source code and debug the engine. I have looked at the inspector classes but it seems that changing a resource array in the inspector correctly changes the data in the scene file. I suspect the issue is that the game instance does not reload the resource array when it is changed. But I don't know what mechanism the game uses to reload resources.\nHow exactly does the game know that a Resource was changed? \n\tDoes it connect to a Signal?\nWhen a scene with a script is instantiated which part loads the exported variables of the script?\n\tis it the Node class, the script class or something else?\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3339933567/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377577133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101979#issuecomment-3377577133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101979","id":3377577133,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JUbyt","user":{"login":"PatIndermuehle","id":153449957,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSV15Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153449957?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle","html_url":"https://github.com/PatIndermuehle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatIndermuehle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-07T16:06:44Z","updated_at":"2025-10-07T16:06:44Z","body":"I have found the issue\nIn the ScriptEditorDebugger when a resource is changed it sends the \"scene:live_node_prop_res\" message with the resource path as argument.\nIn the LiveEditor::_node_set_res_func function it them loads the resource using the path.\nWhen editing a resource array it sends the \"scene:live_node_prop\" message instead with an array of EncodedObjectAsID as argument, which is then never loaded as a resource. This then causes the value to not be updated in the node.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377577133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3953373270","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101979#issuecomment-3953373270","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101979","id":3953373270,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ro7BW","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-24T16:42:56Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T16:42:56Z","body":"Thanks for the report; this is the exact issue I am facing in my current project. Would love to see this resolved.\nAre there any blockers?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3953373270/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"perfor